ORIGINAL WORK

pi-anti-amnesia is an original implementation. It contains no source code copied,
forked or adapted from any third-party repository, and it is not a derivative work
of any published paper or project.

It implements an extension API of the Pi agent runtime, which is loaded at runtime
from a user-chosen installation and is therefore not distributed as part of this
repository.
